                  "notes": "The label enumerates its own constituents, so this is a decomposition rather than a mapping: no ontology has a term for 'Cyclopentanol+CO2', and none could — a combination is not a substance. Minted under the #288 STOCK_SOLUTION convention and split on '+', which transcribes the label rather than inferring anything. 1 of 2 constituents resolve to existing MIM records via docs/data/label_index.csv; Cyclopentanol carries no component_id because MIM has no record for it. ingredient_type=DEFINED_MEDIUM because every constituent is a defined chemical (an unresolved name here means MIM lacks the record, not that the substance is undefined). No concentrations are recorded: the label states none.",
